[41.89, "o", "The server on port 8765 (`$WEB_PORT`) serves this text at `/hello.txt`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nhello from the shared server\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt answered `200 OK` with `Content-type: text/plain`. The response is 29 bytes, which is the text plus a trailing newline. The server is Python's built-in `SimpleHTTP/0.6` (Python 3.13.13), so it's serving a static file from its working directory.\r\n"]
